Hi,

It appears someone at vodafone.pt is running a buggy version of MS
SMTPSVC which seems to be bouncing messages sent to both acpi-devel
and this list back to this list.

Unfortunately, it seems to be causing this list to send out moderation
messages to people whose posts have already been successful (since this
list holds posts which seem to have already come through a mailing list.)

If your message appears in the cpufreq archive, then it has been
successful, and you should ignore the moderation message.

I've informed the acpi-devel list owner, so hopefully the offender
can be removed from their list.

